Lemma tokit_ctor_post_c : forall ra sp gp tp s0 s1 s2 s3 s4 s5 s6 s7 s8 s9 s10 s11 F fc A Fi La W lo wbs m ms,
  tokit_post_c (tokit_cells_after (tok_next false (tok_suffix W Fi wbs)) Fi La) None
    ra sp gp tp s0 s1 s2 s3 s4 s5 s6 s7 s8 s9 s10 s11 F fc A W lo wbs m ms ->
  tokit_ctor_post ra sp gp tp s0 s1 s2 s3 s4 s5 s6 s7 s8 s9 s10 s11 F fc A Fi La W lo wbs m ms.
Proof.
  intros until ms. intros (t0 & t1 & t2 & a0 & a1 & a2 & a3 & a4 & a5 & a6 & a7 & t3 & t4 & t5 & t6 & m' & E & _ & K).
  exists t0, t1, t2, a0, a1, a2, a3, a4, a5, a6, a7, t3, t4, t5, t6, m'. split; [exact E| exact K].
Qed.

